// A durable power of attorney for finances, from Helen Brooks to Marcus Brooks (poa.md).
Document "poa.md".

Fact person Identified by Helen, Marcus
Role principal Is Helen
Role agent Is Marcus
Placeholder third For person
Param gift-limit = $500.00

// P.1, P.4, P.5: when the agent has authority
Bool incapacitated
Event loses-capacity Creates incapacitated
Event regains-capacity Terminates incapacitated
Event death
Bool authority
  Holds when Done(sign(Helen)) && !Done(revoke(Helen)) && !Done(death())
Act sign Actor principal
  Holds when True
Power revoke Actor principal
  Valid when authority && !incapacitated

// P.6: whom a dealing binds (third party without notice is protected)
Fact notice Identified by third
Act give-notice Actor person Recipient third
  Holds when Done(sign(Helen)) && !authority
  Creates notice(third)
Protection third-without-notice Holder third For pay, transfer
  Unless !Done(sign(Helen)) || notice(third)

// P.2, P.3: what the agent may do
Fact dealt Identified by third * amount : USD
Fact unrecorded Identified by third * amount : USD
Power pay, transfer Actor agent Recipient third Related to amount : USD
  Holds when authority
  Valid when authority
  Creates dealt(third, amount), unrecorded(third, amount)
Power give Actor agent Recipient third Related to amount : USD
  Holds when authority && amount <= gift-limit
  Valid when Done(sign(Helen)) && (authority || !notice(third)) && amount <= gift-limit
  Creates dealt(third, amount), unrecorded(third, amount)

Fact account
Function beneficiary Identified by account * person
Power change-beneficiary Actor principal Related to account, person
  Valid when True
  Creates beneficiary(account, person)

// P.7: records and the account
Act record Actor agent Related to third, amount : USD
  Holds when unrecorded(third, amount)
  Terminates unrecorded(third, amount)
Duty account-due Holder agent Claimant Helen
  Due within 30 days
  Created by request-account
  Terminated by give-account
Act request-account Actor principal Recipient agent
  Holds when True
Act give-account Actor agent Recipient principal
  Conditioned by !(Exists unrecorded: unrecorded)

Clause P.1 => principal, agent, sign, authority
Clause P.2/1 => pay, transfer
Clause P.2/2 => pay, transfer, give
Clause P.3/1 => gift-limit, give
Clause P.3/2 => give
Clause P.3/3 => change-beneficiary
Clause P.3/4 => change-beneficiary
Clause P.4/1 Definition
Clause P.4/2 => loses-capacity, regains-capacity, authority
Clause P.5/1 => revoke
Clause P.5/2 => death, authority
Clause P.6/1 => third-without-notice, give
Clause P.6/2 => give-notice, third-without-notice, give
Clause P.7/1 => record, unrecorded
Clause P.7/2 => request-account, account-due, give-account.
